msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Some applications do not support this setting: in particular, GTK "
"applications cannot change animation duration, but will still disable "
"animations when <interface>animation speed</interface> is "
"<interface>Instant</interface>."
msgstr ""
"Sum forrit styðja ekki þessa stillingu: Sérstaklega eru það GTK-forrit sem "
"ekki geta breytt tímalengd myndhreyfinga, en munu samt gera myndhreyfingar "
"óvirkar þegar <interface>hraði myndhreyfinga</interface> er stilltur á "
"<interface>Samstundis</interface>."

